<title>USA: Gibson Greetings names O'Connell chairman.</title>
<headline>Gibson Greetings names O'Connell chairman.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gibson Greetings Inc said Thursday its directors elected Frank O'Connell chairman.</p>
<p>The company said O'Connell will retain his position as chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Gibson said O'Connell will replace Albert Pezzillo, who stepped down as chairman but will remain a director.</p>
